; Custom NSIS Installer Script
; This file contains custom NSIS installer functions and macros
; that are included in the electron-builder NSIS installer
;
; Branding: application icon for shortcuts and Add/Remove Programs comes from
; build/icon.ico (generated from build/meridian-icon.svg via npm run build:brand).
; See build/map-packaging-guide.md and README "Brand assets".

; Custom installer functions can be added here
; Example functions that can be added:
; - Custom installation pages
; - Pre/Post installation actions
; - Registry modifications
; - File associations
; - Custom uninstaller behavior

; For now, this is a minimal include file that allows the build to proceed
; You can add custom NSIS code here as needed

; Example: Custom installation page
; !macro customInstall
;   ; Add custom installation steps here
; !macroend

; Example: Custom uninstall page
; !macro customUnInstall
;   ; Add custom uninstallation steps here
; !macroend
